  "fullContentHtml": "<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<center>\n<!-- Internal_head_07-11-2024 -->\n\n</center>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3a6be1b8 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%;height: 225px\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 36px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Name Of Post :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 36px;border-style: none\">\n<h1><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>CLAT Common Law Admission Test 2027 Apply Online Form 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></h1>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 22px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 35px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Post Date / Update :</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 35px;border-style: none\">03 August 2026 | 10:13 AM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 154px\">\n<td style=\"width: 22.6212%;text-align: center;height: 154px;border-style: none\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><strong>Short Information </strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 77.3788%;height: 154px;border-style: none;vertical-align: middle\">\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Consortium of National Law Universities has released the online application for admission 2027 will start from <strong>03 August 2026</strong> and the last date to apply will be <strong>31 October 2026</strong>. Various universities are participating in CLAT 2027, candidates should read the information brochure for all the information related to the entrance exam like syllabus, eligibility, age limit, placement, fees, college information and other types of information and then apply.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<center>\n<!-- SR26042026_Square -->\n\n</center>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"social-grid\">\n\n<div class=\"social-box telegram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111646.png\">\n        <span>Telegram</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariResult2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box whatsapp\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733585.png\">\n        <span>WhatsApp</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://www.whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va5IElwBlHpVBd6i5a18\" class=\"social-btn\">Join Us</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box instagram\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png\">\n        <span>Instagram</span>\n    </div>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"social-box twitter\">\n    <div class=\"social-left\">\n        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/5968/5968958.png\">\n        <span>X</span>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/srofficial2012\" class=\"social-btn\">Follow</a>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div id=\"v-sarkariresult\"></div>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-48617a69 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;width: 100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 168.95%\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span> </b><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\">Common Law Admission Test CLAT 2027</span></b></span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>CONSORTIUM OF NATIONAL LAW UNIVERSITIES CLAT Exam 2027</strong></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>CLAT 2027 Admission Test : Short Details Of Notification</b></span></h2>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b></b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Important Dates</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Application Begin :<b> 03/08/2026</b></li>\n<li>Last Date for Apply Online : <span style=\"color: #ff0000\"><b>31/10/2026</b></span></li>\n<li>Last Date Pay Exam Fee :<b>31/10/2026</b></li>\n<li>Exam Date Start :<strong>06/12/2026</strong></li>\n<li>Admit Card Available :<b> As Per Schedule</b></li>\n<li>Result Status :<strong>As Per Schedule</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Application Fee</b></span><b></b></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General /OBC : <strong>4000</strong>/-</li>\n<li>SC /ST : <strong>3500</strong>/-</li>\n<li>Pay the Exam Fee Through Online Fee Mode Debit / Credit Card , Net Banking, Mobile Wallet and Other Various Online Fee Mode or Pay the Examination Fee Through Offline E Challan Fee Mode.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>CLAT 2027 Online Form : Age Limit</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>All Eligibility Candidates Can Apply the CLAT 2027 Form.</li>\n<li>NO Upper Age Limit in CLAT 2027</li>\n<li>For More Details Must Read the Full Information Brochure Will be Available at Right Side NLU Wise</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></h3>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\" rowspan=\"3\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>CLAT 2027 Participating Universities List</b></span></h2>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li>NLSIU Bengaluru</li>\n<li>NALSAR Hyderabad</li>\n<li>NLIU Bhopal</li>\n<li>WBNUJS Kolkata</li>\n<li>NLU Jodhpur</li>\n<li>HNLU Raipur</li>\n<li>GNLU Gandhinagar</li>\n<li>GNLU, Silvassa Campus Silvassa</li>\n<li>RMLNLU Lucknow</li>\n<li>RGNUL Punjab</li>\n<li>CNLU Patna</li>\n<li>NUALS Kochi</li>\n<li>NLUO Odisha</li>\n<li>NUSRL Ranchi</li>\n<li>NLUJA Assam</li>\n<li>DSNLU Visakhapatanam</li>\n<li>TNNLU Tiruchirappalli</li>\n<li>MNLU Mumbai</li>\n<li>MNLU Nagpur</li>\n<li>MNLU Aurangabad (Chhatrapati Sambhajinagar)</li>\n<li>\n<div>HPNLU Shimla</div>\n</li>\n<li>DNLU Jabalpur</li>\n<li>DBRANLU Haryana</li>\n<li>\n<div>NLUT AGARTALA</div>\n</li>\n<li>RPNLUP, Prayagraj</li>\n<li>IIULER, Goa,</li>\n<li>NLU, Meghalaya Shillong</li>\n<li>More Read the Information Brochure</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>CLAT UG 2027 Eligibility<br>\n</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under Graduate B.A / LL.B. Hons 5 Years : Passed 10+2 (Intermediate)Exam in Any Recognized Board With 45% Marks</li>\n<li>For Reserve Category: 40% Marks.</li>\n<li>Passed / Appearing Both Candidates Are Eligible</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.0787%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>CLAT PG 2027 Eligibility</b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Post Graduate: LL.B. Degree of Any Recognized University with Minimum 55% Marks.</li>\n<li>For Reserve Category: 50% Marks.</li>\n<li>Passed / Appearing Both Candidates Are Eligible</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>&nbsp;</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>How to Fill </b></span><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b><span style=\"color: #008000\">CLAT Admission Test Online Form 2027</span></b></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Consortium Of National Law Universities are Issued Information Brochure and Invited Online Application Form for the CLAT Admission 2027 Candidate Can Apply Online from <strong>03 August, 2026 to 31 October 2026.</strong></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Admission Application Form in CLAT Admission 2027.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Admission Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full CLAT 2027 Information Brochure Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 168.95%\" colspan=\"10\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.0787%\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 168.95%;text-align: center\" colspan=\"10\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Apply Online</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"CLAT 2027 Registration Link\" href=\"https://consortiumofnlus.ac.in/clat-2027/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>How To Fill Form (Hindi Video)</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"CLAT 2027 Registration Link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/U5xKtz7ibnQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Watch Video</b></a><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download CLAT Notice</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Download CLAT Notice\" href=\"https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/files2027.consortiumofnlus.ac.in/sites/clat2027.consortiumofnlus.ac.in/entity-uploads/notification/attachment/Attachment_720cecc826d8402ab20d3772002b5c77_36562.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download CLAT UG 2027</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"CLAT 2027 Syllabus\" href=\"https://consortiumofnlus.ac.in/clat-2027/ug-syllabus.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Syllabus</a> | <a title=\"CLAT Question Paper Foramt\" href=\"https://consortiumofnlus.ac.in/clat-2027/ug-question-format.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Question Paper Format</a></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.0787%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download CLAT PG 2027</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b><a title=\"CLAT 2027 PG Syllabus\" href=\"https://consortiumofnlus.ac.in/clat-2027/pg-syllabus.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Syllabus</a> | <a title=\"CLAT Question Paper Format\" href=\"https://consortiumofnlus.ac.in/clat-2027/pg-question-format.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Question Paper Format</a></b><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.0787%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Download Participating University List</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"CLAT 2027 Participating University PDF\" href=\"https://consortiumofnlus.ac.in/clat-2027/participating_universities.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.0787%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008080\"><b>Signature Resizer, PDF Compress, Age Calculator and More Tools</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 47.0787%\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.0787%;text-align: center\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Official Website</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 121.872%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"CLAT Admission 2026 Official Website\" href=\"https://consortiumofnlus.ac.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>CLAT Official Website</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n<div>\n\n<!-- Internal_header_07-11-2024 -->\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6da1cb96\">\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-325acb59\"><span class=\"gb-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" role=\"img\" height=\"1em\" width=\"1em\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M207.029 381.476L12.686 187.132c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l22.667-22.667c9.357-9.357 24.522-9.375 33.901-.04L224 284.505l154.745-154.021c9.379-9.335 24.544-9.317 33.901.04l22.667 22.667c9.373 9.373 9.373 24.569 0 33.941L240.971 381.476c-9.373 9.372-24.569 9.372-33.942 0z\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"gb-headline-text\"><strong><em>Frequently Asked Questions</em></strong></span></h3>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-97950a91 gb-headline-text\"><h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1nlecbm\" data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"96\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q1. When did the CLAT Admission 2027 Online Application Process Start?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"178\">The online application process started on <strong data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"743\">03 August 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1e84k3r\" data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"474\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q2.</strong><strong>What is the Exam Date for CLAT Admission 2027?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"553\">The Examination will begin on <strong>06 December 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q3. Where can I find the syllabus for the CLAT Admission Examination?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">The detailed syllabus and examination scheme are available in the official notification. Candidates are advised to read the notification carefully for complete details.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q4. How can I download the CLAT Admission 2027 Notification PDF?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can download the notification through SarkariResult.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"kyy6a2\" data-start=\"180\" data-end=\"221\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q5. What is the last date to apply online for CLAT 2027 Admission Online Form 2026?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"222\" data-end=\"305\">The last date to apply online is <strong>31 October 2026.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"1dih1sd\" data-start=\"307\" data-end=\"359\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><strong>Q6. What is the last date to CLAT 2027 Admission pay the application fee?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"433\">Candidates can pay the application fee up to <strong data-start=\"742\" data-end=\"758\">31 October 2026</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left\" data-section-id=\"o0mtqe\" data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"592\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><strong>Q7. How can I apply for CLAT Admission Online Form 2027?</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left\" data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"655\">Candidates can apply online through the official recruitment link available on <strong data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1334\">SarkariResult.com (Since 2012) – Official Website of Sarkari Result®</strong>.</li>\n</ul>\n<figure id=\"attachment_27954\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-27954\" style=\"width: 2550px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-27954\" title=\"Sarkari Result CLAT 2027 Online Form\" src=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/clat2027-scaled.png\" alt=\"CLAT 2027 Online Form\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1467\" srcset=\"https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/clat2027-scaled.png 2560w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/clat2027-300x172.png 300w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/clat2027-1024x587.png 1024w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/clat2027-768x440.png 768w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/clat2027-1536x880.png 1536w, https://www.sarkariresult.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/clat2027-2048x1174.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\"><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-27954\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">CLAT 2027 Online Form Sarkari REsult</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n\n\n\n<!-- Main Pajes 2 -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
